2Ch 31:1 , The people is forward in destroying idolatry;
2Ch 31:2 , Hezekiah orders the courses of the priests and Levites, and provides for their work and maintenance;
2Ch 31:5 , The people's forwardness in offerings and tithes;
2Ch 31:11 , Hezekiah appoints officers to dispose of the tithes;
2Ch 31:20 , The sincerity of Hezekiah.
